{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2015-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1444953600, "end_date": 1445644799, "month_true_total": 58, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:51:19 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "18644272", "author": {"steamid": "76561198109233713", "personaname": "WesleyWyndemPryce", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198109233713/", "num_games_owned": 283, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 612, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 612, "last_played": 1438533975, "avatar": "60a08004ab4caf17dee67aeabda1d156d08dff11"}, "language": "english", "review": "excelent game highly nostalgic for war hammer 40k fans and a good action sci fi game for new fans", "timestamp_created": 1445627436, "timestamp_updated": 1445627436, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18635343", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995974962", "personaname": "Kernal Kirchhoff", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197995974962/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 3677, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1981, "last_played": 1710271276, "avatar": "709a7c4a8e4bbe80ce2e50be4572d3c5c5171f78"}, "language": "english", "review": "MAIM!!! KILL!! BURN!!! Ultramarine style.", "timestamp_created": 1445584187, "timestamp_updated": 1445584187, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18634830", "author": {"steamid": "76561197996819935", "personaname": "@realCousinOkri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197996819935/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 1659, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1365, "last_played": 1726601222, "avatar": "148a1da1406df7e7d12b72a622acea2b04b6f82c"}, "language": "english", "review": "For fans of WARHAMMER 40k, this game is a must. Tight melee combat, weighty shooting, exceptionally pretty gore, great soundtrack - this game has it all. The passable story is overshadowed by fun and intense gameplay. The mutilplayer is suprisingly good, offering loads of aesthetic and loadout customization for both Space Marines and their heretical ex bros. Survival mode is also suprisingly fun. \n\nAlso you are Mark Strong.", "timestamp_created": 1445579625, "timestamp_updated": 1445579625, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18607693", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042771679", "personaname": "Risby", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/devrisby/", "num_games_owned": 1061, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 516, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 516, "last_played": 1445583963, "avatar": "0c1ddc9645147a9969afbe229e711492c38b57f1"}, "language": "english", "review": "Not worth buying at full price (which currently is $30), because:\n\n- Very Shallow (no upgrade system, no exploration, very simple barebones combat system where you can't even get in cover and combos are pretty much button mashing and very awkward)\n\n- Repetive and linear in a bad way (literally go from point A to B, killing the boring variety of enemies over and over again)\n\n- Controls (on controller, didnt try KB+M) feel sluggish and awkward. This issue becomes very apparent when trying to execute enemies for health\n\n- Frustrating (there are difficulty spikes and controls/ combat system makes it worse. For example the only way you get health back is by executing enemies, however there is a long animation process that takes place while executing, and you can get killed during sequence, like WTF!)\n\nOther than that, its just a mindless simple, medicore game. Not worth the full price, but its ok for a sale purchase", "timestamp_created": 1445467268, "timestamp_updated": 1445476458, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.473133116960525513", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "18598890", "author": {"steamid": "76561198045754322", "personaname": "elyfont", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/nolefty/", "num_games_owned": 203, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 4325, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 895, "last_played": 1788738448, "avatar": "d392c70227c5d9c1ac1d9a061f3a58d963478865"}, "language": "english", "review": "install gentoo", "timestamp_created": 1445429847, "timestamp_updated": 1445429847, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.462458014488220215", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}]}